  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A year ago, Kaho married Shinya, who worked at an advertising agency. Their married life ended abruptly when she discovered his infidelity.\n\nThe void in her heart was unexpectedly filled by Iori, a younger college student. \"I'm here for you, Kaho.\"\n\nThough drawn to Iori, Kaho now faces pressure from Shinya to reconcile. Torn between two men, she must choose:\n\n\"Do I embrace this new love? Or repair what was broken?\""
  },
